de isomerate, caprylyl glycol, phytosteryl/octyldodecyl lauroyl glutamate, hydroxypropyltrimonium hyaluronate, polyglyceryl-4 caprate, polyglyceryl-6 caprylate, caprylyl glyceryl ether, 1,2-hexanediol, sodium citrate, leuconostoc/radish root ferment filtrate, citric acid, sodium hydroxide.</p><p><br></p><p>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</p></div></details>",
